OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over island's food
OL,4,Asecurity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said: "The resilience of
OL,7,FJersey's supply-chain has been
OL,8,Fdemonstrated over many winters, and
OL,9,Fsuppliers and DFDS have measures in
OL,10,Fplace to cope with weather-related
OL,11,Fdisruption."
